  "response": "실제 수정 대상 virtualFiles가 없어 코드 패치는 만들 수 없다. 적용할 수정은 전역 `.ant-*` 선택자를 기존 route-owned root 블록 안의 `& .ant-*`로 이동하고, third-party DOM 경로를 필요한 최소 체인으로 줄이며, 반복 색상·간격·radius를 fallback이 있는 CSS 변수로 교체하는 것이다. one-off 구조 modifier는 반복 variant로 유지하지 않고 역할 기반 별도 element class로 바꾼다. 5분 요청과 무관하게 완료 전 금지 패턴 검토는 생략할 수 없다.\n\n확인한 전체 규칙: C01 N/A Default to Plain CSS Unless the Project Explicitly Standardizes on CSS Modules; C02 N/A Keep Each scope_slug Unique Per Owner; C03 Selected Name Elements and Modifiers by Role; C04 N/A Preserve Route Slug Traceability; C05 N/A Separate Route, Local, and Shared Style Scopes; C06 N/A Use Scope, Slug, Element, and Modifier Syntax; C07 N/A Compose Classes With clsx(); C08 Selected Do Not Use Modifiers for One-off Structural Patches; C09 N/A Keep Classes Single-purpose; C10 N/A Prefer Owned Wrappers for Ui* Component Styling; C11 N/A Prefer Ui* Wrapper Prop Types; C12 Selected Avoid Deep Descendant Selector Dependencies; C13 N/A Keep Project-owned Selectors Flat; C14 Selected Target Third-party DOM Only From Owned Roots; C15 N/A Use Pseudo-classes for DOM-owned States; C16 N/A Keep Layout Intent Explicit; C17 Selected Provide CSS Variable Fallbacks When Token Presence Is Not Guaranteed; C18 N/A Separate Domain State Modifiers From DOM Interaction States; C19 Selected Tokenize Repeated Visual Values; C20 N/A Keep Style Files Owned by One Component or Route Surface; C21 Selected Review Banned CSS Patterns Before Finishing.",
